<title>SPAIN: Spain's Valenciana posts 16 pct rise in Q1 net.</title>
<headline>Spain's Valenciana posts 16 pct rise in Q1 net.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Valenciana de Cementos, a unit of Mexico's Cemex said on Wednesday its first quarter net consolidated profit rose 16 percent to 4.23 billion pesetas.</p>
<p>Turnover rose 94 percent to 56.28 billion pesetas.</p>
<p>The strong growth rates were due to the consolidation of U.S. and Venezuelan affiliates acquired in December 1996, the firm said.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
